OL,3,GNEWSASchools told to 'dob in' e-scooter
OL,4,Apupils to police
OL,5,
OL,6,FSchools in Lincolnshire are being asked
OL,7,Fto report pupils who arrive on
OL,8,Fe-scooters to the police.
OL,10,FLincolnshire County Council is to write
OL,11,Fto headteachers asking them to report
OL,12,Fstudents riding illegally on roads,
OL,13,Fpavements and other public spaces.
OL,15,FIt comes after a 14-year-old boy died
OL,16,Fin a crash involving his e-scooter and
OL,17,Fa van near Lincoln. Councillor Natalie
OL,18,FOliver said the council move would "try
OL,19,Fto prevent such tragic circumstances
OL,20,Ffrom happening".
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
