OL,3,GNEWSASchools told to 'dob in' e-scooter
OL,4,Apupils to police
OL,5,
OL,6,FStuart Hamer, principal of Lincoln
OL,7,FUniversity Technical College (UTC),
OL,8,Fsaid: "My foremost concern is the
OL,9,Fwelfare of my students and if that's
OL,10,Fdobbing them in, because that's going
OL,11,Fto get a hard message home, then that's
OL,12,Fgot to be the way we go."
